  "Nothing can escape a black hole.",
  "These objects are so compact that gravity traps even light.",
  "Einstein’s theory predicts they form when mass curves spacetime.",
  "The boundary of no escape is called the event horizon.",
  "Crossing this horizon traps an object inside without any detectable change.",
  "At the center lies a singularity where spacetime curvature becomes infinite."
